# seproj v1 rate=120
# t <tick> <fnv1a64 of the block>, then per entity in SpawnIndex order:
# <spawn> <x> <y> <rotation> <HP> [<stat>=<value> ...] (%.9g, '-' = absent)
t 0 0123456789abcdef
0 200 200 0 100 Charge=10
1 500.25 300 359.9995 64
2 10 20 90 - Speed=500
3 0 0 0 1
t 1 0123456789abcdef
0 201 200 0 100 Charge=10
1 500.5 300 0.0004 64
2 11 20 90 - Speed=500
3 0.001 -0.001 0 1
